# No copied test UI

Do not rebuild production markup in a test or fixture. Render the component the app mounts. Supply props, `BrowserAppShell`, and mocks for hooks or browser APIs.

A duplicated button row, layout, or copy will pass while the live screen drifts.

If the real component is hard to render, mock the dependency or make the component accept props. Do not redraw the screen in the test file.
